sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant MedusaAPI as Medusa API
    participant PaymentMod as Payment Module
    participant StripeBase
    participant StripeSDK as Stripe SDK
    participant StripeWebhook as Stripe Webhooks

    Note over Client,StripeWebhook: Payment Initiation
    Client->>MedusaAPI: POST /store/carts/:id/payment-sessions
    MedusaAPI->>PaymentMod: createPaymentSession(data)
    PaymentMod->>StripeBase: initiatePayment({ amount, currency_code, context })
    StripeBase->>StripeBase: getSmallestUnit(amount, currency_code)
    StripeBase->>StripeBase: normalizePaymentIntentParameters(data)
    StripeBase->>StripeSDK: stripe.paymentIntents.create(intentRequest, { idempotencyKey })
    StripeSDK-->>StripeBase: PaymentIntent { id, status }
    StripeBase-->>PaymentMod: { id: pi_xxx, status: "pending" }
    PaymentMod-->>MedusaAPI: PaymentSession { id, data: { id: pi_xxx, ... } }
    MedusaAPI-->>Client: { payment_session }

    Note over Client,StripeWebhook: Authorization (status poll)
    MedusaAPI->>PaymentMod: authorizePaymentSession(id)
    PaymentMod->>StripeBase: authorizePayment({ data })
    StripeBase->>StripeSDK: stripe.paymentIntents.retrieve(pi_xxx)
    StripeSDK-->>StripeBase: PaymentIntent { status: "requires_capture" }
    StripeBase-->>PaymentMod: { status: "authorized" }
    PaymentMod-->>MedusaAPI: PaymentSession updated

    Note over Client,StripeWebhook: Capture
    MedusaAPI->>PaymentMod: capturePayment(id)
    PaymentMod->>StripeBase: capturePayment({ data, context })
    StripeBase->>StripeSDK: stripe.paymentIntents.capture(pi_xxx, { idempotencyKey })
    StripeSDK-->>StripeBase: PaymentIntent { status: "succeeded" }
    StripeBase-->>PaymentMod: { data: <intent> }

    Note over StripeWebhook,PaymentMod: Async Webhook (parallel path)
    StripeWebhook->>MedusaAPI: POST /hooks/payment/stripe (payment_intent.succeeded)
    MedusaAPI->>PaymentMod: processEvent(event)
    PaymentMod->>StripeBase: getWebhookActionAndData(body, headers)
    StripeBase-->>PaymentMod: { action: "captured", data: { session_id } }
    PaymentMod->>PaymentMod: updatePaymentSession(status: "captured")

    Note over Client,StripeWebhook: Refund
    Client->>MedusaAPI: POST /admin/orders/:id/refunds
    MedusaAPI->>PaymentMod: refundPayment({ amount, data })
    PaymentMod->>StripeBase: refundPayment({ amount, data })
    StripeBase->>StripeBase: getSmallestUnit(amount, currency)
    StripeBase->>StripeSDK: stripe.refunds.create({ payment_intent, amount })
    StripeSDK-->>StripeBase: Refund object
    StripeBase-->>PaymentMod: { data: <refund> }
    PaymentMod-->>MedusaAPI: Refund created
    MedusaAPI-->>Client: { refund }
